  "review_findings": [
    "Standard compiled iterated local search using neighbor-list 2-opt and Or-opt, double-bridge perturbation and a nonworsening acceptance rule. No learned component.",
    "Two instances are processed together with Numba prange, using at most two CPU threads. This is not GPU-kernel acceleration.",
    "Prediction budget is min(900, 30*ceil(number_of_instances/2)) seconds: 480 seconds for 32 development/confirmation instances, 900 seconds for 64 audit instances. Recorded worker times agree.",
