    "Audit mean route length 10.57809 versus 10.93352 reference, 3.2508% improvement, passes the original 2% plus uncertainty conditions. Delivery 33.57505 minutes. More budget than repetition 0 is not a paired timing ablation because task instances and source differ.",
    "Two paid proposals, one unused. The control counterpart is still running, so no full TSP paired average or optimization-family verdict is inferred."
